Description: Provides ExperimentHub metadata and documentation for the
    promoter-background score distributions used by PscanR transcription
    factor binding motif enrichment analyses. Each of the 105 backgrounds is a
    separate ExperimentHub resource, covering the JASPAR 2020, 2022 and 2024
    CORE collections, seven genome assemblies of five organisms, and five
    promoter windows. The files are hosted on Zenodo, one record per JASPAR
    release, and archived together in a version-specific Zenodo record.
